{"ticker":"SOLV","updated":"2026-10-30T23:13:20Z","profile":{"longName":"Solventum Corporation","shortName":"Solventum Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.solventum.com","fullTimeEmployees":20584,"marketCap":13844295680,"trailingPE":9.954713,"forwardPE":11.193306,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.6659802,"pegRatio":1.22,"targetMeanPrice":94.69231,"targetHighPrice":113.0,"targetLowPrice":71.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.022,"earningsGrowth":0.039,"grossMargins":0.54777,"operatingMargins":0.09778,"profitMargins":0.17256,"totalRevenue":8310000128,"beta":0.703,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":94.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.38,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Solventum Corporation, a healthcare company, develops, manufactures, and commercializes a portfolio of solutions to address critical customer and patient needs in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Medsurg, Dental Solutions, and Health Information Systems. The Medsurg segment offers solutions, such as negative pressure wound therapy, advanced wound dressings, advanced skin care, synthetic tissue matrices, I.V. site management, sterilization assurance, temperature management, surgical supplies, medical tapes and wraps, stethoscopes, medical electrodes, and medical technologies for original equipment manufacturers. The Dental Solutions segment provides dental and orthodontic products, including brackets, aligners, restorative cements, and bonding agents to span the life of the tooth, and products for preventative dental care, direct and indirect restoration, and orthodontic needs. The Health Information Systems segment offers healthcare systems with software solutions comprising computer-assisted physician documentation, direct-to-bill and coding automation, classification methodologies, speech recognition, and data visualization platforms. The company sells its products and services through direct-to-consumer, distribution, key account management, inside sales, and e-commerce. Solventum Corporation was incorporated in 2023 and is headquart","summary_zh":"Solventum Corporation 是一家醫療保健公司，開發、製造和商業化一系列解決方案，以滿足美國和國際上的關鍵客戶和患者需求。它透過三個部門運作：Medsurg、牙科解決方案和健康資訊系統。 Medsurg 部門提供解決方案，例如負壓傷口治療、先進傷口敷料、先進皮膚護理、合成組織基質、靜脈注射。為原始設備製造商提供現場管理、滅菌保證、溫度管理、手術用品、醫用膠帶和包裝、聽診器、醫用電極和醫療技術。牙科解決方案部門提供牙科和矯正產品，包括矯正器、矯正器、修復水泥和延長牙齒使用壽命的黏合劑，以及用於預防性牙科護理、直接和間接修復以及矯正需求的產品。健康資訊系統部門為醫療保健系統提供軟體解決方案，包括電腦輔助醫生文件、直接計費和編碼自動化、分類方法、語音識別和資料視覺化平台。該公司透過直接面向消費者、分銷、大客戶管理、內部銷售和電子商務來銷售其產品和服務。 Solventum Corporation 成立於 2023 年，總部","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.33,"h":72.413,"l":70.94,"c":71.82,"v":1020800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":71.48,"h":71.63,"l":70.56,"c":71.4,"v":804300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":71.59,"h":72.48,"l":70.535,"c":72.38,"v":794100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":72.57,"h":73.49,"l":72.43,"c":72.72,"v":682800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":72.53,"h":75.6,"l":72.278,"c":74.6,"v":1507900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":74.1,"h":74.48,"l":72.865,"c":72.9,"v":930100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":72.54,"h":73.175,"l":71.145,"c":71.22,"v":1006600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":71.01,"h":73.965,"l":71.01,"c":73.79,"v":1425900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":73.48,"h":74.49,"l":73.025,"c":73.39,"v":1572400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":73.33,"h":74.07,"l":72.91,"c":73.21,"v":1563400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":73.28,"h":74.35,"l":73.105,"c":74.13,"v":1008100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":74.23,"h":75.5,"l":73.8,"c":74.07,"v":1712900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":74.22,"h":75.085,"l":74.13,"c":74.37,"v":918600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":74.62,"h":74.75,"l":73.68,"c":73.72,"v":1491900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":73.13,"h":74.349,"l":73.13,"c":73.76,"v":1484200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":73.68,"h":74.22,"l":73.06,"c":73.39,"v":787600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":73.12,"h":73.23,"l":71.535,"c":71.82,"v":827700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":71.07,"h":71.42,"l":69.36,"c":70.46,"v":1279